<title>USA: Hibbing PUC, Minn., won by First of America.</title>
<headline>Hibbing PUC, Minn., won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America said it won $5.335 million of Hibbing Public Utilities Commission, Minn., general obligation public utilities revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.63 percent.</p>
</text>
